WEBVTT

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:04.030
With the match against
Blue Panther around the corner,

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:08.160
we'd like to get
Hagiwara's thoughts on it.

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:09.320
I'm sorry!

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:12.660
We're busy preparing for our
rookie's important debut match!

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:13.870
No comment!

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.200
Hagiwara Sakura isn't
available for interviews!

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.660
The nerve of them...

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:20.380
They should be
interviewing Moe-<i>chan</i> first.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.840
I'm sorry, Moe-<i>chan.</i>

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.590
Not to worry!

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.840
I'm just happy to go up
against you, Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.140
Okay, I'll face you with all I've got!

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.220
Yes!

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:34.060
Um, Sakura-<i>sempai</i>?

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.310
Can I bother you for a sec?

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:40.060
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:43.230
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:51.870
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:05.130
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:10.630
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:16.260
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:21.310
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:26.860
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:32.240
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:35.120
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:41.790
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.500
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:47.710
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.800
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:55.640
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:58.720
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:06.230
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:13.650
Episode 10: Sakura's Fate!

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:15.310
Korakuen Hall is filled to
the brim with Berserk fans!

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:19.060
We'll finally get a
chance to see the prospect!

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:31.870
And here she is! Fukuoka Moe!

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:36.200
The high school wrestler
will finally make her debut!

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:50.720
Sakura...!

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:53.680
Sakura-<i>chan</i>...!

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:00.940
Hagiwara...!

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.240
Sakura...!

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:21.040
Okay! Ready, go!

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:30.340
Those are karate steps!

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:31.880
Her moves are hard to read.

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:34.300
I better put some distance...

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:36.390
What?!

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.020
<i>Sei</i>!

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:43.650
I can't hit her?!

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:46.770
But if I move away,
she'll just close in on me.

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.570
How's this?!

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:53.450
Ha!

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:00.250
I'm not done yet!

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:01.870
Ta!

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:13.590
What's this?!

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:18.010
Unlike Hagiwara, the
rookie, Fukuoka is smiling!

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:23.560
Is her composure here coming
from her mastery in karate?!

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:27.650
The world champ of
Bugen-style karate is for real!

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:33.240
Um, Sakura-<i>sempai</i>?

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.610
Can I bother you for a sec?

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:42.250
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>, do you
still care about being an idol?

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:43.210
Huh?

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:48.340
I left the world of karate
to challenge pro wrestling.

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:53.630
But even after I made my
choice, I'm a bit nervous now.

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:59.220
Once I'm in the pro's ring,
there's no turning back to karate.

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:02.810
Grandpa wouldn't forgive
me for quitting now, and...

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:05.440
I wouldn't forgive myself either.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.190
Right...

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:13.110
But, I can't take my mind
away from the choice I made.

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:14.820
Moe-<i>chan...</i>

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:20.240
Now!

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.540
The Octopus Hold!

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:32.500
It's former pro wrestler,
Great Fukuoka's special move!

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:35.840
Fukuoka Moe got her
grandfather's move on firm, and

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:38.970
is putting the pressure on Hagiwara!

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:50.980
But now that I'm here,
there's no time to worry, right?

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:55.240
And anyways, I'm really
enjoying pro wrestling, so...

00:05:55.440 --> 00:06:00.200
I'll just keep moving
forward! Right, Sakura-<i>sempai</i>?!

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:17.550
Wait... It isn't working?!

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:30.400
Okay! Rope break!

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:34.730
Sakura's having a tough time.

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:36.360
Yeah...

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:46.410
With how she's using the whole ring

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:49.210
it won't be easy making your move.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:51.290
Not so sure about that...

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:53.290
What do you mean?

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:57.840
This is fun!

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:00.760
It's fun fighting with Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:06.220
I need to show more of Moe's stuff here!

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:10.520
That move again... She's coming in!

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:12.690
Huh?

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:16.900
That's weird.
My body isn't listening to me...

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:19.070
Her move stopped...

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.610
Th-That's...!

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:27.040
Hagiwara returns the
Octopus with a Cobra Twist!

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:33.710
I get it! She's tired out!

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:36.090
Even if she's a talented fighter,

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:38.590
this is still her first professional match.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:41.380
She doesn't know what pacing is about.

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:43.760
O-Owww...!

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:46.390
Okay! Rope break!

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:50.890
<i>Sei</i>!

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:06.910
Rope!

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:19.000
O-Owww...!

00:08:37.940 --> 00:08:40.610
Moe-<i>chan</i> looks like she's at her limit.

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:43.650
I better end this match.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:54.960
One...!

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.580
Two...!

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:00.590
Did I go too easy there?

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:02.840
Well then, how about this?!

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:10.100
One...!

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:11.720
Two...!

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:15.140
It still wasn't enough?

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:18.270
She should already be past her limit...

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:22.230
The Sakura Special
would do the trick, but

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:26.360
it's too dangerous to
use on Moe-<i>chan</i>'s first match.

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:30.700
This was my dream match
against Sakura-<i>sempai</i>, but...

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.580
...I'm so pathetic!

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:37.210
I want her to see how strong Moe is!

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:41.380
I want her to use her Sakura Special!

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:44.710
Her eyes... What's next...?

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:48.800
Ha!

00:09:58.600 --> 00:09:59.810
I've got her!

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:01.310
One...!

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:02.940
Two...!

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.450
I know how Moe-<i>chan</i> feels...

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:13.490
She's enjoying the
match, and pro wrestling!

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:18.710
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>, do you
still care about being an idol?

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:23.420
But, I can't take my mind
away from the choice I made.

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:26.420
It's the same for me too, Moe-<i>chan.</i>

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:29.590
I'm always worried too.

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:33.470
What kind of crap is she thinking of now...?

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:37.430
But, I'm enjoying pro wrestling too!

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:42.020
That's why I need to move on!

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:46.280
There's no turning back from pro wrestling!

00:10:57.120 --> 00:11:00.420
There it is! The Sakura Special!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:01.880
One...!

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:03.500
Two...!

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:06.000
She should've used that in the first place.

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:08.300
Thinking too much as usual.

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:11.680
Three!

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:20.140
What an exciting debut for Fukuoka Moe!

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:23.980
Despite being a rookie,
her blows hit hard on Hagiwara

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:27.980
but in the end,
she fell to the Sakura Special!

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:31.780
Are you okay?
Can you stand up, Moe-<i>chan</i>?

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.910
Y-Yes...

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:36.030
Fukuoka Moe may have lost,

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:40.210
but the match was
something to be proud of!

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:43.370
You did great, Fukuoka!

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.210
Moe-<i>chan</i>...!

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:48.300
I'll be coming to see you again next time!

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:51.420
That was really fun, Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:55.050
Thank you very much
for using the Sakura Special!

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:56.050
Right!

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:58.720
Let's get stronger, Moe-<i>chan</i>!

00:11:58.930 --> 00:11:59.520
Yes!

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:02.600
- Moe-<i>chan</i>!
- Moe-<i>chan</i>...!

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:14.760
There's no time to rest!

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:19.060
You won't last
against Blue Panther like that!

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:23.860
Is this really supposed to be a spar?

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:26.740
Kazama-<i>san</i> looks so serious...

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:41.040
She's no chump. She'll go in for the kill.

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:43.040
C'mon, now what?!

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:53.760
The training against
Blue Panther is working, right?

00:12:55.220 --> 00:13:00.440
After all, we're the ones
training you after we faced her.

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:02.190
It's not enough.

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:06.070
Her fighting style isn't clear yet.

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:07.320
She's right...

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:11.150
Sanada Juri's strength as the
Blue Panther is hard to fathom.

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:14.740
We can't be satisfied
with what we've done.

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.540
I knew she wasn't
an ordinary wrestler, but...

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:21.120
I can't believe Blue
Panther was Sanada Juri-<i>san.</i>

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:25.750
Sanada Juri-<i>san</i> is the
founder of Miyabi, right?

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:28.000
Is she that strong?

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:32.550
We were rivals here in Berserk before.

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:35.800
Our challenge to
Shangri-La didn't overlap, but...

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:38.850
Juri is ranked higher
than me now in the world.

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.850
Higher than Toyoda-<i>san</i>?!

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:44.480
You could say she's my greatest rival.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:48.400
There's a reason I got
beat easily, you know?

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:50.490
I don't know what Juri's plans are.

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:53.200
But one thing is clear...

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:58.410
Blue Panther is going after you, Sakura.

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:02.210
W-What's the matter, Moe-<i>chan</i>?

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:05.460
I-I'm sorry. I just freaked myself out...

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:06.130
What?

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:09.130
I can't imagine seeing
Sakura-<i>sempai</i> lose, but...

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:11.420
it sounds like Juri-<i>san</i> is really strong.

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:15.180
If the worst happens,
what should Moe do...?

00:14:15.390 --> 00:14:18.140
Don't worry. I won't lose.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:21.930
I want to have more
matches against Moe-<i>chan</i>, right?

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:24.770
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>...!

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:29.270
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>! Please, please win this!

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:30.820
Right!

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:33.780
That's right... I can't lose.

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:37.240
As a professional
wrestler, I'm responsible...

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:41.910
for holding myself in
front of everyone with pride!

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:45.120
Look at this huge theater!

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:51.250
This soon-to-be-opened theater
is dedicated for Sweet Diva!

00:14:51.320 --> 00:15:00.290
Chief Manager
Kirishima Makoto

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.720
In line with the grand
opening of the theater,

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:57.300
we're preparing a
musical performance by all

00:14:57.510 --> 00:15:00.220
one hundred fifty of
our Sweet Diva members.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:04.500
SD Theater Opening Performance
150 Sweet Divas come together!

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:04.480
We also have concerts
set in fourteen countries

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:10.300
Worldwide 14 Country Performance
World Tour Decided!

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:06.900
and once the theater
performance is done,

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:10.320
they will go right into their world tour!

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:14.050
Chief Manager
Kirishima Makoto

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:14.030
Sweet Diva will be
soaring through the world!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:22.440
How is everything going?

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:28.900
Kanno Nanami

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:23.410
We're all working together as one.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:25.910
We'll make this performance one that

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:28.670
people will never forget!

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:32.910
Looks like you're both well prepared.

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:48.670
Mochizuki Yuho

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:48.670
Hayase Aika

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:34.760
I-I'm sorry... I'm out of breath...

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:36.300
Hi ya there!

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:39.640
This'll be an awesome
performance, so don't miss out!

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:41.510
Oh, and not to forget...

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:45.230
Everyone in the world, see you all soon!

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:48.520
W-We'll see you... soon...

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:59.070
Do you have any thoughts
to share on your world debut?

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:00.780
I'm confident.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:06.040
Our goal has always been to
entertain the people of the world.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:07.250
I see...

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:08.670
But...

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:12.380
There's still something Sweet Diva lacks...

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:14.250
As in...?

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:20.010
May I go now?

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:23.470
Huh? Oh, yes.
Thank you very much.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:01.500
Daily Girls' Pro Wrestling

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:08.350
The time has finally come!

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:09.980
The match that all pro wrestling fans...

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:14.440
no, everyone has been waiting for!

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.610
The mysterious, masked Blue Panther

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:19.490
and the national idol
wrestler, Hagiwara Sakura's

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:22.240
special match is about to begin!

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:23.030
Ready!

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:26.100
HAGIWARA SAKURA

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:27.240
Super-cute, super-cute, Sa-ku-ra!

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:30.000
Hey, isn't that...?

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:31.370
Toyoda Misaki?!

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:34.710
What's Toyoda Misaki doing in the corner?

00:17:41.050 --> 00:17:42.840
It's about to start...

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:47.560
Today's main event will now begin!

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:53.850
In the blue corner,
entering is Hagiwara Sakura!

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:01.740
Sakura.

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:03.360
R-Rio-<i>san</i>?!

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:04.700
Don't you be losing!

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:07.490
I'm not gonna let you retire, you hear?

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:08.740
Yes!

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:10.370
Go get her!

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:23.720
Misaki-<i>san...</i>

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:47.910
Next, in the red corner,
entering is Blue Panther!

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:16.560
The Blue Panther versus Hagiwara Sakura

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:19.400
special match will start!

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:22.860
In the blue corner,
we have the dancing top idol!

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:29.240
The eternal center
position, Hagiwara Sakura...!

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:35.000
In the red corner, we have the mysterious

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:40.630
renegade masked
wrestler, Blue Panther...!

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:47.090
In as referee is Inukai Natsuho.

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:52.060
The match will follow the
<i>mascara contra cabellera</i> rules

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:54.600
where Blue Panther will put her mask

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:57.770
and Hagiwara will put her hair on line.

00:19:57.980 --> 00:20:03.070
Also, the loser will
retire from pro wrestling!

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:10.570
Sakura's the best junior we've got.

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:14.290
After all, she's fighting for us and Berserk.

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:17.460
But... this'll be harsh...

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:18.790
No!

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:24.710
I don't wanna see
Sakura-<i>sempai</i> lose and retire!

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:27.170
I feel the same way too!

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:29.840
Rio-<i>san...</i>

00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:33.470
But... her opponent is that strong.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:35.770
Sakura didn't make it obvious, but...

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:40.560
I'm sure she's prepared for the worst.

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:47.150
Now, the gong to this
evening's premiere is about to ring!

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:53.740
Wait! Blue Panther is
walking towards Hagiwara.

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:56.370
What's going on...?!

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:58.000
That's...

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:02.790
Wait! The gong hasn't rung yet.

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:22.900
We're finally here.
I have no use for this mask now.

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:29.190
No...

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:35.160
It can't be...!

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:38.240
Elena?!

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:42.790
<i>Three, Two, One, and here we go!</i>
<i>Let's shoot for the greatest stage</i>

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:45.380
<i>Dancing & singing, let's liven things up!</i>

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:50.210
<i>Together it's a brand new day,</i>
<i>c'mon everyone's cheers are</i>

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:53.090
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:21:57.510 --> 00:22:02.690
<i>Dreams are our heart's sun</i>

00:22:02.890 --> 00:22:08.320
<i>Let's make them real with our magic</i>

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:13.780
<i>Fashion, makeup, but inside's a passion</i>

00:22:13.990 --> 00:22:17.830
<i>to a bright future</i>

00:22:18.030 --> 00:22:18.950
<i>Step up!!</i>

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:21.620
<i>The spotlight shines</i>

00:22:21.830 --> 00:22:24.290
<i>Microphone stand, fluttering skirts</i>

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:31.670
<i>The heart's rhythm, swing</i>
<i>swing, notes dance, it's show time!!</i>

00:22:31.880 --> 00:22:37.800
<i>Watch me be No. 1 someday, your No. 1</i>

00:22:38.010 --> 00:22:39.010
<i>Let's sing (All day long)</i>

00:22:39.220 --> 00:22:40.640
<i>Let's dance (All night long)</i>

00:22:40.850 --> 00:22:48.730
<i>With all my love,</i>
<i>more than being first, your smile</i>

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:50.360
<i>is what I want to see (Hold me tight)</i>

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:54.320
<i>Let's make true my dream</i>

00:22:54.530 --> 00:22:55.570
<i>Anytime, do my best</i>

00:22:55.780 --> 00:22:57.110
<i>Do your best and don't give up</i>

00:22:57.320 --> 00:22:59.620
<i>Dancing & singing, as yourself</i>

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:01.080
<i>If you like it, it's all fine</i>

00:23:01.290 --> 00:23:04.660
<i>The beat in your heart is your answer</i>

00:23:04.870 --> 00:23:07.500
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:23:10.160 --> 00:23:34.720
Episode 11: Pure Soul!

00:23:10.300 --> 00:23:11.260
It can't be...

00:23:11.470 --> 00:23:15.680
Blue Panther was Miyazawa Elena?!

00:23:15.890 --> 00:23:18.270
What in the world is going on here?!

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:22.690
Isn't she a member of Sweet
Diva and Sakura-<i>chan</i>'s friend?!

00:23:22.900 --> 00:23:24.780
And she doesn't have any wrestling experience...

00:23:24.980 --> 00:23:25.990
What the...?!

00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:27.780
She's unbelievably strong!

00:23:27.990 --> 00:23:30.410
Sakura-<i>chan</i> is having a fight of her life!

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:34.370
Chief! What's gonna happen to this match?!

00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:39.730
A request from Sakura:

00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:39.730
There are a lot of pro wrestling moves in "Sekatsuyo,"
but they're dangerous, so please don't try them at home!
